// Dockmaster Hale — the "Return the Maguffin" fetch quest (quest 1, item 1).
// Offer, in-progress reminder, turn-in, and the refusal branch that ends in a
// fight. Beating him sets npc_defeated, which is why the refusal router has a
// "gave up" side.

title: entry
---
<<if quest_state(1, "Success")>>
    <<jump already_done>>
<<elseif quest_state(1, "InProgress")>>
    <<jump inprogress>>
<<else>>
    <<jump offer>>
<<endif>>
===

title: inprogress
---
// Handing it in works even if the cube was picked up before the quest.
<<if has_item(1)>>
    <<jump turnin>>
<<else>>
    <<jump reminder>>
<<endif>>
===

title: already_done
---
$npc: The cube's back under lock and key, thanks to you. The station owes you one.
===

title: reminder
---
$npc: Any sign of my Maguffin Cube? Small, purple, hums like a bad capacitor. It's around here somewhere.
===

title: offer
---
$npc: A courier fumbled my Maguffin Cube somewhere on this deck and I can't leave my post. Would you track it down for me?
-> I'll find it
    <<set_quest 1 InProgress>>
    <<jump offer_accept>>
-> Not now
    $npc: Hmph. It won't walk back on its own.
===

title: offer_accept
---
<<if has_item(1)>>
    <<jump turnin>>
<<else>>
    <<jump offer_much_obliged>>
<<endif>>
===

title: offer_much_obliged
---
$npc: Much obliged. It's a small purple cube with a hum you can feel in your teeth — you can't miss it.
===

title: turnin
---
$npc: That hum — you found it! Hand it over, courier.
-> Hand it over
    <<jump complete>>
-> I'm keeping it
    <<jump refusal>>
===

title: refusal
---
<<if npc_defeated("intro.dockmaster_hale")>>
    <<jump refusal_gaveup>>
<<else>>
    <<jump refusal_demand>>
<<endif>>
===

title: refusal_gaveup
---
$npc: Then it walks off with you. I'm not testing that arm twice.
===

title: refusal_demand
---
$npc: That cube is station property, courier. Last chance — hand it over, or I take it.
-> Try and take it
    <<start_battle>>
    <<stop>>
-> Fine, take it
    <<jump complete>>
===

title: complete
---
<<take_item 1>>
<<set_quest 1 Success>>
$npc: Yes, that's the one. You have my thanks, courier.
===
